        "ggGb_5xJ16__text": "<span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong>Vitamin D3:</strong></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(80,0,11);font-size:px;\"> Strengthen Bones, Immunity, &amp; Hormones</span>",
        "ggmfMqAqcmg_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:px;\">IM8 is developed by a world-renowned Scientific Advisory team from Mayo Clinic, Yale, Cedars-Sinai, and the former NASA Chief Scientist. Backed by rigorous science and testing, this formulation goes beyond basic nutrition, offering the credibility and trustworthiness IM8 delivers 100% of your daily value of Vitamin D3, an essential nutrient for bone density, immune defense, and hormone balance. Since most people lack adequate sunlight exposure, this is your go-to solution for a deficiency-free life, empowering you to stay healthy from the inside out.you’d expect from a product built by top-tier health a.</span></p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-609001069090964023"
