        "gg5rNmKbQef_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:px;\">This power duo is vital for your overall well-being. Zinc strengthens your immune system, while magnesium promotes muscle recovery and deep, restorative sleep. IM8 uses bioavailable forms of these minerals for maximum effectiveness, ensuring you wake up refreshed and ready to tackle the day.</span></p>",
        "ggstOLVwOjU_text": "<span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong>Zinc and Magnesium:</strong></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(80,0,11);font-size:px;\"> Fortify Immunity, Sleep, &amp; Recovery</span>"
      },
