        "ggnTLpQxikg_text": "<span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong>B-Vitamins Complex:</strong></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(80,0,11);font-size:px;\"> Energize &amp; Optimize Brain Health</span>",
        "gguUO3_CG0e_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:px;\">IM8's B-Vitamin Complex goes beyond basic energy support. With bioavailable forms of B6, B12, and Folate, it helps your body combat fatigue, boost brain function, and regulate mood. By delivering 150% of your daily needs, it ensures sustained energy and cognitive clarity, even on your busiest days.</span></p>"
      },
