        "ggP58p7TSFQ_text": "<span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong>Prebiotics, Probiotics, and Postbiotics:</strong> The Ultimate Gut Health Trio</span>",
        "ggz2hm6coqi_text": "<p>IM8 goes beyond probiotics by including prebiotics, probiotics, and postbiotics for comprehensive gut health. Clinically validated strains like Lactobacillus acidophilus and Bifidobacterium lactis support digestion, while postbiotic Butyrate ensures optimal nutrient absorption and gut comfort. Your digestive system has never felt this supported.</p>"
