        "gg7Uwm8lL-y_text": "<span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong>Superfood and Adaptogen Blend:</strong></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(80,0,11);font-size:px;\"> Powerhouse Antioxidants for Whole-Body Vitality</span>",
        "ggXQz0x7cwY_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:px;\">Experience the benefits of IM8’s superfood and adaptogen blend, featuring green tea, açai, pomegranate, and sea moss. These nutrient-dense ingredients combat free radicals, reduce inflammation, and enhance metabolism, helping you stay energized and balanced in every aspect of life.</span></p>"
