        "ggZnvGk7lVM_text": "<span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong>Electrolyte Hydration Blend:</strong> Stay Hydrated &amp; Replenished</span>",
        "gguWDBsY1dU_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:px;\">IM8 includes an advanced electrolyte blend of sodium, potassium, and magnesium, providing balanced hydration without the added sugars found in most drinks. Whether you’re recovering from a workout or a long day, this blend ensures your body stays hydrated, energized, and ready for anything.</span></p>"
